tools.description:
Journeys between two places in Norway by train, bus, tram, metro or boat (Vy, SJ Nord, Go-Ahead, Ruter, Skyss…): times, platforms, transfers, live delays, cancellations.
Use when: someone travels by public transport in Norway (e.g. Oslo to Bergen).
Example: {"from":"Oslo S","to":"Bergen stasjon"}

Next departures from one Norwegian station or stop (train, bus, tram, metro, boat): time, line, destination, platform, live delay, cancellations.
Use when: someone is at (or going to) a stop in Norway.
Example: {"station":"Oslo S"}

Finds Norwegian stations and stops matching a word, with their ids.
Use when: a place name is ambiguous or misspelled.
Example: {"query":"Bergen"}
